				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-4595576/the-three-bullets-of-destiny#post-3664963</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 26 Dec 2017 20:23:03 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>MaliceAforethought</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2902864</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Its creme white surface was scratched with age, despite this, it still contrasted sharply against the brown grip.</p> </blockquote> <p>Should be a semicolon instead of the first comma, and &quot;creme&quot; is usually used as a pretentious/French spelling of 'cream' in the context of cooking: I've never seen it used to mean the colour cream.</p> <p>Aside from that, it's a great tale, and I love the fact that <em>nobody dies</em>. It's an anomaly that's a weapon, and everybody lives, and it has a happy ending. Well played.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
